{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZGfoFbRa4PN6CgiXaw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Shipping an open speech model inside an app raises practical questions about size, provenance and licensing, and the AnySpeechRecognizer announcement answers several of them. The authors converted the models to Core ML and published them on the Hugging Face Hub, and the package downloads them only when an app asks. Each Parakeet is about 600 MB, and the optional live-input encoder adds about 590 MB. Qwen3-ASR ranges from 0.9 to 2.4 GB, and the Sortformer diarization model is about 250 MB. Files go into the standard Hugging Face cache, so a Mac app running outside the sandbox shares them with Python and other Hugging Face tools.\n\nEach repository records its source checkpoint and a checksum for every file, and the package pins a fixed revision. The conversion workflows are in the repository, most of them following FluidInference's mobius scripts, and each conversion is checked against the original model. The licenses differ by model: CC BY 4.0 for Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, Parakeet Ultra and Streaming Sortformer v2, the NVIDIA Open Model License for Parakeet Unified and Sortformer v2.1, and Apache 2.0 for both Qwen3-ASR sizes. An app that bundles several engines therefore inherits several sets of terms.\n\nThe Parakeet repositories also include an 8-second encoder for live input. According to the authors, it cuts live analysis time by about a third at the cost of a somewhat higher word error rate. They report that Parakeet uses about 100 MB of memory once Core ML has compiled the model, while Qwen3-ASR needs a few gigabytes.\n\nSome requirements limit where this runs today. Both packages need Swift 6.2 and macOS 26 or iOS 26, and the Parakeet and Sortformer runtimes need Apple silicon. AnySpeechRecognizer is at version 0.1.0, and its dependency on swift-huggingface 1.x currently prevents combining it with AnyDecisionModel's CoreAI trait, because coreai-kit 0.7.3 requires swift-huggingface below 1.0."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":9302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1119},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd18c5f8-2302-4498-9962-d47d36bcbea1","uuid":"e6a4c121-535a-4e8e-83ef-82789305e71a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:34:36.077Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZGfUenfzzoxhf6H95E"}
